                                "sense_id": "8a584211-31ff-3e93-afe3-7cf39916a347",
                                "text": "Womack went into the bedroom and checked on his two boys. When I headed to the bathroom to drain my anaconda, I caught a profile of him standing in the doorway, smiling down on the little rascals."
                            },
